+### Including multiple mapping configurations
+
+The `IncludeMappingConfigurationAttribute` can be applied multiple times to the same method
+to include the configurations of several mapping methods.
+This is useful if a type implements multiple interfaces and each interface has its own mapping configuration:
+
+```csharp
+[MapProperty(nameof(IAudit.CreatedBy), nameof(IAuditDto.Creator))]
+private partial void MapAudit(IAudit audit, IAuditDto dto);
+
+[MapProperty(nameof(IOwnable.Owner), nameof(IOwnableDto.OwnerName))]
+private partial void MapOwnable(IOwnable ownable, IOwnableDto dto);
+
+// highlight-start
+[IncludeMappingConfiguration(nameof(MapAudit))]
+[IncludeMappingConfiguration(nameof(MapOwnable))]
+// highlight-end
+public partial HouseDto ToDto(House house);
+```
+
+If multiple included configurations share the same base configuration (e.g. both include the same mapping method),
+the shared configuration is only applied once.
+
